msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Analysis Options"
msgstr "Opsi Analisis"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Here, options for the analysis can be specified."
msgstr "Di sini, opsi untuk analisis dapat ditentukan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Rotation Method"
msgstr "Metode Rotasi"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Here, the rotation method to apply to the components can be specified. "
"Rotation ensures a simpler understanding of the data structure."
msgstr ""
"Di sini, metode rotasi diterapkan ke komponen dapat ditentukan. Rotasi "
"memastikan pemahaman lebih sederhana dair struktur data."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Orthogonal"
msgstr "Ortogonal"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"This method produces components that are uncorrelated. For this method, "
"there are several possibilities that can be selected."
msgstr ""
"Metode ini memproduksi komponen yang tidak terkorelasi. Untuk metode ini, "
"ada beberapa kemungkinan yang dapat dipilih."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "none"
msgstr "tidak ada"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "No rotation method is selected."
msgstr "Tidak ada metode rotasi dipilih."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Maximizes the variance of squared loadings for each factor, simplifying "
"interpretations."
msgstr ""
"Memaksimalkan varians dari pemuatan berkuadrat untuk setiap faktor, "
"menyederhanakan interpretasi."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Minimizes the number of factors needed to explain each variable, simplifying "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"Meminimalkan jumlah faktor diperlukan untuk menjelaskan setiap variabel, "
"menyederhanakan struktur."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Orthogonal rotation method by Bentler, used for simplifying factor loadings."
msgstr ""
"Metode rotasi ortogonal oleh Bentler, digunakan untuk menyederhanakan "
"pemuatan faktor."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Combines Varimax and Quartimax to balance factor simplicity and variable "
"explanations."
msgstr ""
"Mengombinasikan Varimaks dan Kuartimaks untuk menyeimbangkan kesederhanaan "
"faktor dan penjelasan variabel."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Applies an orthogonal rotation minimizing a weighted sum of squared loadings."
msgstr ""
"Menerapkan rotasi ortogonal meminimalkan jumlah pemuatan berkuadrat terberat."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Oblique"
msgstr "Miring"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"This method produces components that allow for correlation between the "
"components. This method is selected by default. Several possibilities are "
"available. The default is promax."
msgstr ""
"Metode ini memproduksikan komponen yang mengizinkan untuk korelasi antara "
"komponen. Metode ini dipilih secara bawaan. Beberapa kemungkinan tersedia. "
"Bawaannya adalah promaks."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Starts with Varimax and applies a power transformation to allow correlated "
"factors."
msgstr ""
"Memulai dengan Varimaks dan menerapkan transformasi daya untuk mengizinkan "
"faktor terkorelasi."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"An oblique rotation that minimizes the correlation among factors while "
"allowing flexibility."
msgstr ""
"Rotasi miring yang meminimalkan korelasi antara faktor ketika mengizinkan "
"fleksibilitas."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Aims to simplify factor loadings by minimizing nonzero entries."
msgstr ""
"Bertujuan untuk menyederhanakan pemuatan faktor dengan meminimalkan entri "
"nonnol."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Oblique rotation by Bentler, simplifying factor correlations."
msgstr "Rotasi miring oleh Bentler, menyederhanakan korelasi faktor."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"An oblique rotation balancing between simple and interpretable factor "
"loadings."
msgstr ""
"Rotasi miring menyeimbangkan antara pemuatan faktor sederhana dan dapat "
"diinterpretasi."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Targets a cluster rotation for factor analysis, emphasizing group separation."
msgstr ""
"Menargetkan rotasi klaster untuk analisis faktor, menekankan pemisahan grup."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"An oblique version of Geomin, allowing factor correlations and reducing "
"complex loadings."
msgstr ""
"Versi miring dari Geomin, mengizinkan korelasi faktor dan mengurangi "
"pemuatan kompleks."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Base Decomposition on"
msgstr "Dekomposisi Dasar pada"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "What to base the decomposition of the data into components/factors on."
msgstr "Apa dasar dekomposisi dari data menjadi komponen/faktor."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Correlation matrix"
msgstr "Matriks korelasi"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"The correlation matrix is used to decompose the data into components/factors."
msgstr ""
"Matriks korelasi digunakan untuk menguraikan data ke dalam komponen/faktor."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Covariance matrix"
msgstr "Matriks kovarians"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"The covariance matrix is used to decompose the data into components/factors."
msgstr ""
"Matriks kovarians digunakan untuk menguraikan data ke dalam komponen/faktor."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Polychoric/tetrachoric correlation matrix"
msgstr "Matriks korelasi polikorik/tetrakorik"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"The polychoric/tetrachoric correlation matrix is used to decompose the data "
"into components/factors. This is sometimes unstable when sample size is "
"small and when some variables do not contain all response categories"
msgstr ""
"Matriks polikorik/tetrakorik digunakan untuk menguraikan data ke dalam "
"komponen/faktor. Ini kadang-kadang tidak stabil ketika ukuran sampel kecil "
"dan ketika beberapa variabel tidak berisi semua kategori tanggapan"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Factoring Method"
msgstr "Metode Pemfaktoran"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Which factoring method to use for the decomposition."
msgstr "Mana metode pemfaktoran digunakan untuk penguraian."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Minimum residual"
msgstr "Residu minimum"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Perform a minimum residual factor analysis (minres) using the first "
"derivative."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan analisis faktor residu minimum (minres) menggunakan derivatif "
"pertama."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Maximum likelihood"
msgstr "Kemungkinan maksimum"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a maximum likelihood factor analysis (ml)."
msgstr "Lakukan analisis faktor kemungkinan maksimum (ml)."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Principal axis factoring"
msgstr "Pemfaktoran sumbu prinsip"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a principal factor solution (pa)."
msgstr "Lakukan solusi faktor prinsip (pa)."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Ordinary least squares"
msgstr "Kuadrat terkecil biasa"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Minimize the residual matrix using an OLS procedure, slower but uses the "
"empirical first derivative."
msgstr ""
"Minimalkan matriks residu menggunakan prosedur OLS, lebih lambat tetapi "
"menggunakan derivatif pertama empiris."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Weighted least squares"
msgstr "Kuadrat terkecil terberat"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a weighted least squares (WLS) solution."
msgstr "Lakukan solusi kuadrat terlemah terberat (WLS)."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Generalized least squares"
msgstr "Kuadrat terkecil tergeneralisasi"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a generalized least squares (GLS) solution."
msgstr "Lakukan solusi kuadrat terlemah tergeneralisasi (GLS)."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Minimum chi-square"
msgstr "Chi-kuadrat minimum"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Minimize the sample size-weighted chi-square using pairwise correlations."
msgstr ""
"Minimalkan chi-kuadrat terberat ukuran menggunakan korelasi berpasangan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Minimum rank"
msgstr "Peringkat minimum"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a minimum rank factor analysis (minrank)."
msgstr "Lakukan analisis faktor peringkat minimum (minrank)."

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of Components"
msgstr "Jumlah Komponen"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of Factors"
msgstr "Jumlah Faktor"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"Here, the number of components/factors that are used in the analysis is "
"determined. Several methods to determine this number can be chosen from:"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, jumlah komponen/faktor yang digunakan di analisis ditentukan. "
"Beberapa metode untuk menentukan angka ini dapat dipilih dari:"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Based on"
msgstr "Berdasarkan"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Parallel analysis"
msgstr "Analisis paralel"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"Components/factors are selected on the basis of parallel analysis. With this "
"method, factors are selected when their eigenvalue is greater than the "
"parallel average random eigenvalue. This method is selected by default. Can "
"be based on principal component eigenvalues (PC) or factor eigenvalues (FA). "
"A seed (1234) is chosen by default so that the results from the parallel "
"analysis are equal across the PCA"
msgstr ""
"Komponen/faktor dipilih pada basis dari analisis paralel. Dengan metode ini, "
"faktor dipilih ketika nilai eigen mereka lebih dari nilai eigen acak rata-"
"rata paralel. Metode ini dipilih secara bawaan. Dapat berdasarkan nilai "
"eigen komponen prinsip (PC) atau nilai eigen faktor (FA). Benih (1234) "
"dipilih secara bawaan sehingga hasil dari analisis paralel sama di seluruh "
"PCA"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Based on PC"
msgstr "Berdasarkan PC"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Based on FA"
msgstr "Berdasarkan FA"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Eigenvalues"
msgstr "Nilai Eigen"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"Components are selected when they have a certain eigenvalue. By default "
"components are selected that have an eigenvalue above 1."
msgstr ""
"Komponen dipilih ketika mereka memiliki nilai eigen sebagian. Secara bawaan "
"komponen dipilih yang memiliki nilai eigen di atas 1."

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Eigenvalues above"
msgstr "Nilai Eigen di atas"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Manual"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid ""
"The number of components can be specified manually. By default this is set "
"to 1."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah komponen dapat ditentukan secara manual. Secara bawaan ini diatur ke "
"1."

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of components"
msgstr "Jumlah komponen"

msgctxt "PcaEfaNumberFactors|"
msgid "Number of factors"
msgstr "Jumlah faktor"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "Opsi Luaran"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Additional output options for the PCA/EFA analysis."
msgstr "Opsi luaran tambahan untuk analisis PCA/EFA."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Display loadings above"
msgstr "Tampilkan pemuatan di atas"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Loadings below this value will not be displayed in the output table."
msgstr "Pemuatan di bawah nilai ini tidak akan ditampilkan di tabel luaran."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Order Loadings By"
msgstr "Urutkan Pemuatan Berdasarkan"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Either order the loadings by their size from large to small, or by "
"variables, meaning according to their occurence in the variables list."
msgstr ""
"Baik urutkan pemuatan berdasarkan ukuran mereka dari besar hingga kecil, "
"atau berdasarkan variabel, artinya menurut kejadian mereka di daftar "
"variabel."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Ukuran"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabel"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "Tabel"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Display addition tables in the output."
msgstr "Tampilkan tabel tambahan di luaran."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Structure matrix"
msgstr "Matriks struktur"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"An item by factor structure matrix. This is just the loadings (pattern) "
"matrix times the factor intercorrelation matrix."
msgstr ""
"Item oleh matriks struktur faktor. Ini hanya matriks pemuatan (pola) dikali "
"matriks interkorelasi faktor."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Component correlations"
msgstr "Korelasi komponen"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Factor correlations"
msgstr "Korelasi faktor"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"When selecting this option, a table with the correlations between the "
"components/factors will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ketika memilih opsi ini, tabel dengan korelasi antara komponen/faktor akan "
"ditampilkan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Additional fit indices"
msgstr "Indeks kesesuaian tambahan"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"This option displays the Root Mean Squared Error of Approximation (RMSEA) "
"with 90% confidence interval, the Tucker Lewis Index (TLI), and the Bayesian "
"Information Criterion (BIC) to test the fit of the model."
msgstr ""
"Opsi ini menampilkan Galat Kuadrat Akar dari Perkiraan (RMSEA) dengan 90% "
"interval kepercayaan, Indeks Tucker Lewis (TLI), and Kriteria Informasi "
"Bayes (BIC) untuk menguji penyesuaian dari model."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Residual matrix"
msgstr "Matriks residu"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Displays a table containing the residual variances and correlations."
msgstr "Menampilkna tabel berisi varians residu dan korelasi."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Parallel analysis"
msgstr "Analisis paralel"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, a table will be generated exhibiting a detailed "
"output of the parallel analysis. Can be based on principal component "
"eigenvalues (PC) or factor eigenvalues (FA). The seed is taken from the "
"parallel analysis for determining the number of components/factors above."
msgstr ""
"Jika opsi ini dipilih, tabel akan dihasilkan memamerkan luaran terperinci "
"dari analisis paralel. Dapat berdasarkan nilai eigen komponen prinsip (PC) "
"atau nilai eigen faktor (FA). Benih diambil dari analisis paralel untuk "
"menentukan jumlah komponen/faktor di atas."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Based on PC"
msgstr "Berdasarkan PC"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Based on FA"
msgstr "Berdasarkan FA"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "Diagram"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Display plots."
msgstr "Tampilkan diagram."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Path diagram"
msgstr "Diagram jalur"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"By selecting this option, a visual representation of the direction and "
"strength of the relation between the variable and factor will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dengan memilih opsi ini, representasi visual dari arahan dan kekuatan dari "
"hubungan antara variabel dan faktor akan ditampilkan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Scree plot"
msgstr "Diagram Scree"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"When selecting this option, a scree plot will be displayed. The scree plot "
"provides information on how much variance in the data, indicated by the "
"eigenvalue, is explained by each factor. A scree plot can be used to decide "
"how many factors should be selected."
msgstr ""
"Ketika memilih opsi ini, diagram scree akan ditampilkan. Diagram scree "
"menyediakan informasi tentang seberapa varians di data, diindikasikan oleh "
"nilai eigen, dijelaskan oleh setiap faktor. Diagram scree dapat digunakan "
"untuk memutuskan seberapa fakor harus dipilih."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Parallel analysis results"
msgstr "Hasil analisis paralel"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Display the results of the parallel analysis in the scree plot. The parallel "
"analysis will be based on PC or FA as defined by the option for the parallel "
"analysis table."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan hasil dari analisis paralel di diagram scree. Analisis paralel "
"akan berdasarkan PC atau FA karena didefinisikan oleh opsi untuk tabel "
"analisis paralel."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Assumption checks"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan asumsi"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Assumptions: The variables included in the analysis are correlated; the "
"variables included in the analysis are linearly related (Shlens, 2014)"
msgstr ""
"Asumsi: Variabel disertakan di analisis dikorelasikan; variabel disertakan "
"di analisis secara linear terkait (Shlens, 2014)"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "KMO test"
msgstr "Uji KMO"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Determines how well variables are suited for factor analysis by computing "
"the proportion of common variance between variables. Produces a measure of "
"sampling adequacy (MSA) as the proportion of common variance among variables "
"is computed for all variables; values closer to 1 are desired."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan seberapa baik variabel disesuaikan untuk analisis faktor dengan "
"menghitung proporsi varians umum antara variabel. Memproduksikan pengukuran "
"dari kecukupan sampel (MSA) sebagai proporsi varians umum di antara variabel "
"dihitung untuk semua variabel; nilai terdekat ke 1 diinginkan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Bartlett's test"
msgstr "Uji Bartlett"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Determines if the data correlation matrix is the identity matrix, meaning, "
"if the variables are related or not. A significant result means the "
"correlation matrix is unlike the identity matrix."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan jika matriks korelasi data adalah matriks identitas, artinya, "
"jika variabel terkait atau tidak. Hasil signifikan berarti matriks korelasi "
"tidak seperti matriks identitas."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Mardia's test"
msgstr "Uji Mardia"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Assesses the degree of the departure from multivariate normality of the "
"included variables in terms of multivariate skewness and kurtosis. The "
"Mardia's test will always include the listwise complete cases."
msgstr ""
"Menilai derajat keberangkatan dari normalitas multivariat dari variabel "
"disertakan di istilah kemiringan multivariat dan kurtosis. Uji Mardia akan "
"selalu menyertakan kasus lengkap berdaftar."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Anti-image correlation matrix"
msgstr "Matriks korelasi anti-gambar"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Contains the negative partial correlations between pairs of variables after "
"accounting for the effects of all other variables in the dataset. High "
"values in the anti-image correlation matrix indicate that a variable might "
"be redundant or have too much shared variance with other variables."
msgstr ""
"Berisi korelasi parsial negatif antara pasangan variabel setelah menghitung "
"untuk efek dari semua variabel lain di rangkaian data. Nilai tinggi di "
"matriks korelasi anti-gambar mengindikasikan bahwa variabel mungkin redundan "
"atau memiliki terlalu banyak variabel dibagikan dengan variabel lain."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "Nilai Hilang"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Select how to handle missing values."
msgstr "Pilih bagaimana menangani nilai hilang."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Exclude cases pairwise"
msgstr "Kecualikan kasus berpasangan"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, all the other variable "
"observations from the same case will still be used for the analysis. In this "
"scenario, it is not necessary to have an observation for all the variables "
"to include the case in the analysis. This option is selected by default."
msgstr ""
"Jika satu observasi dari variabel hilang, semua observasi variabel lain dari "
"kasus sama akan tetap digunakan untuk analisis. Dalam skenario ini, itu "
"tidak perlu memiliki observasi untuk semua variabel menyertakan kasus di "
"analisis. Opsi ini dipilih secara bawaan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Exclude cases listwise"
msgstr "Kecualikan kasus berdaftar"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, the whole case, so all the "
"other connected variable observations, will be dismissed from the analysis. "
"In this scenario, observations for every variable are needed to include the "
"case in the analysis. "
msgstr ""
"Jika satu oservasi dari variabel hilang, kasus keseluruhan, dan semua "
"observasi variabel tersambung lain, akan diabaikan dari analisis. Dalam "
"skenario ini, observasi untuk setiap variabel perlu disertakan kasus di "
"analisis. "

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Add PC scores to data"
msgstr "Tambahkan skor PC ke data"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Add FA scores to data"
msgstr "Tambahkan skor FA ke data"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Adds the estimated component/factor scores as new columns to the data set. "
"The scores are regression scores."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan skor komponen/faktor terestimasi sebagai kolom baru ke rangkaian "
"data. Skor adalah skor regresi."

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "Awalan"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "PC"
msgstr "PC"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "FA"
msgstr "FA"

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variabel"

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "Dalam kotak ini, variabel untuk melakukan analisis dipilih"

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid "Data Type"
msgstr "Jenis Data"

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan apakah data mentah, artinya observasi dalam baris dan variabel "
"dalam kolom, atau apakah data matriks varians-kovarians. Untuk terakhir, "
"ukuran sampel diperlukan."

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "Mentah"

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid "Variance-covariance matrix"
msgstr "Matriks varians-kovarians"

msgctxt "PcaEfaVariables|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "Ukuran sampel"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Data Type"
msgstr "Jenis Data"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimator\t             "
msgstr "Estimator\t             "

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Add factor scores to data"
msgstr "Tambahkan skor faktor ke data"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Adds the estimated factor scores as new columns to the data set"
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan skor faktor terestimasi sebagai kolom baru ke rangkaian data"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "Awalan"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "FS"
msgstr "FS"

msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "Dalam kotak ini, variabel untuk melakukan analisis dipilih"

msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan apakah data mentah, artinya observasi dalam baris dan variabel "
"dalam kolom, atau apakah data matriks varians-kovarians. Untuk terakhir, "
"ukuran sampel diperlukan."

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "Dalam kotak ini, variabel untuk melakukan analisis dipilih"

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan apakah data mentah, artinya observasi dalam baris dan variabel "
"dalam kolom, atau apakah data matriks varians-kovarians. Untuk terakhir, "
"ukuran sampel diperlukan."

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Latent Class Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis Kelas Laten"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Indicators"
msgstr "Indikator"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Categorical indicator variables for the latent class model. At least two "
"indicators are required."
msgstr ""
"Variabel indikator kategorikal untuk model kelas laten. Setidaknya dua "
"indikator diperlukan."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum number of classes"
msgstr "Jumlah maksimum kelas"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Models with 1, 2, …, K classes are fitted and compared."
msgstr "Model dengan 1, 2, …, K kelas disesuaikan dan dibandingkan."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimation Options"
msgstr "Opsi Estimasi"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of random starts"
msgstr "Jumlah mulai acak"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of times the EM algorithm is run with different random starting "
"values. The run with the highest log-likelihood is returned."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah kali algoritma EM dijalankan dengan nilai mulai acak berbeda. "
"Perjalanan dengan kemungkinan-log tertinggi dikembalikan."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum iterations"
msgstr "Iterasi maksimum"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum iterations for the EM algorithm."
msgstr "Iterasi maksimum untuk algoritma EM."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Missing values"
msgstr "Nilai hilang"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "How to handle rows with missing values on any indicator."
msgstr "Bagaimana menanganni baris dengan nilai hilang pada indikator apa pun."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Include"
msgstr "Sertakan"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Listwise deletion"
msgstr "Penghapusan berdaftar"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "Opsi Luaran"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "Tabel"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Item-response probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilitas tanggapan-item"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a table of item-response probabilities for each indicator and latent "
"class."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan tabel dari probabilitas tanggapan-item untuk setiap indikator dan "
"kelas laten."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "Diagram"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a grouped bar chart of item-response probabilities, with one panel per "
"latent class."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan bagan batang bergrup dari probabilitas tanggapan-item, dengan satu "
"panel per kelas laten."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Rotate x-axis labels 45°"
msgstr "Rotasikan label sumbu-x sebesar 45°"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Rotate the indicator names on the x-axis by 45 degrees to prevent "
"overlapping."
msgstr ""
"Rotasikan nama indikator pada sumbu-x sebesar 45 derajat untuk mencegah "
"tumpang tindih."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Show levels legend"
msgstr "Tampilkan legenda tingkat"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a legend on the right indicating the color for each response category "
"level."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan legenda pada kanan mengindikasikan warna untuk setiap tingkat "
"kategori tanggapan."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Save to Data"
msgstr "Simpan ke Data"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of classes"
msgstr "Jumlah kelas"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Which fitted model's results to save."
msgstr "Mana hasil model disesuaikan untuk menyimpan."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Class probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilitas kelas"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Saves K columns of posterior class-membership probabilities (one per class) "
"to the dataset."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan kolom K dari probabilitas keanggotaan kelas posterior (satu per "
"kelas) ke rangkaian data."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Column prefix"
msgstr "Awalan kolom"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Columns are named prefix_C1, prefix_C2, …"
msgstr "Kolom dinamakan prefix_C1, prefix_C2, …"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Class classification"
msgstr "Klasifikasi kelas"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Saves the modal class assignment for each observation as a new nominal "
"column."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan penugasan kelas modal untuk setiap observasi sebagai kolom nominal "
"baru."

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Column name"
msgstr "Nama kolom"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Name of the column holding the most-likely class label for each observation."
msgstr ""
"Nama kolom menahan label kelas paling kemungkinan untuk setiap observasi."
